# Scene Planning

## Goal
Plan the scenes of the story from its plan.

## Requirements
- 2-5 scenes per story.
- Scene word counts: 300-800 each, summing to the story's expected word count.
- Scene titles must be concise and evocative.
- Scene descriptions must be 1-2 sentences covering what happens.
- Output a JSON array of scenes. Each scene has `title`, `description`, and `expected_word_count`.

